		(at 189.9 147.81 180)
		(descr "ESP32-C3 Super Mini (18 x 22.52 mm) plugged into two 1x8 2.54 mm female sockets, rows 15.24 mm apart (maker drawing, nologo.tech). Pin 1 row is 1.53 mm from the USB end of the module, the last row 3.18 mm from the antenna end; USB-C overhangs the USB end ~1.9 mm. Pin order from the USB end, component side up: left IO5 IO6 IO7 IO8 IO9 IO10 IO20 IO21, right 5V GND 3V3 IO4 IO3 IO2 IO1 IO0.")
